 ("1.7 Centrifugal Pump Components", "Pump components"), ("1.13 Centrifugal Pump Diffuser", "Diffuser"), ("1.14 Stuffing Box, Gland, and Packing", "Stuffing box and packing"), ("1.15 Packing and Lantern Ring", "Lantern ring"), ("1.16 Wearing Rings", "Wearing rings"), ("1.22 Net Positive Suction Head", "Net positive suction head"), ("1.38 Radial Flow Pumps", "Flow classification"), ("1.41 Multistage Centrifugal Pump", "Multistage pumps"), ("1.59 Centrifugal Pump Operation – Pump Startup", "Startup"), ("1.88 Reciprocating Pumps", "Reciprocating pumps"), ("1.90 Single- and Double-Acting Pumps", "Simplex and duplex"), ("1.101 Rotary Moving Vane Pump", "Rotary pumps"), ("1.112 PDP Overpressure Protection", "Overpressure protection"), ("1.3 ALIP Parts", "ALIP parts", AP), ("1.4 ALIP, How It Works!", "ALIP operation", AP),
